{
  "format": "spreadsheet-app",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Monthly Budget | September 2026",
  "pages": [
    {
      "name": "September Budget",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Overview",
          "source": "# September 2026\n\nPlan monthly spending by category, record income and expenses, and compare this month’s expense totals with the plan. Enter all transaction amounts as positive numbers; **Kind** determines whether a row is income or spending.\n\n{% let income = SUMIFS(Transactions[Amount], Transactions[Kind], \"Income\", Transactions[Date], \">=\"&DATE(2026, 9, 1), Transactions[Date], \"<\"&DATE(2026, 10, 1)) %}\n{% let spending = SUMIFS(Transactions[Amount], Transactions[Kind], \"Expense\", Transactions[Date], \">=\"&DATE(2026, 9, 1), Transactions[Date], \"<\"&DATE(2026, 10, 1)) %}\n**Income:** {{ TEXT(income, \"$#,##0.00\") }} · **Spending:** {{ TEXT(spending, \"$#,##0.00\") }} · **Left after spending:** {{ TEXT(income-spending, \"$#,##0.00\") }}\n\nThe budget and ledger use September 2026 dates. Update the date window in this overview if you reuse the workbook for another month."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "name": "Budget",
          "rowCount": 7,
          "colCount": 4,
          "columns": [
            { "name": "Category", "type": "text" },
            { "name": "Planned", "type": "number" },
            {
              "name": "Actual",
              "type": "formula",
              "formula": "=SUMIFS(Transactions[Amount], Transactions[Kind], \"Expense\", Transactions[Category], [Category], Transactions[Date], \">=\"&DATE(2026, 9, 1), Transactions[Date], \"<\"&DATE(2026, 10, 1))"
            },
            { "name": "Remaining", "type": "formula", "formula": "=[Planned]-[Actual]" }
          ],
          "formats": [
            {
              "startRow": 0,
              "endRow": null,
              "startCol": 1,
              "endCol": 3,
              "format": { "numberFormat": "$#,##0.00" }
            }
          ],
          "cells": [
            { "row": 0, "col": 0, "input": "Housing" },
            { "row": 0, "col": 1, "input": "1800" },
            { "row": 1, "col": 0, "input": "Utilities" },
            { "row": 1, "col": 1, "input": "220" },
            { "row": 2, "col": 0, "input": "Groceries" },
            { "row": 2, "col": 1, "input": "600" },
            { "row": 3, "col": 0, "input": "Transportation" },
            { "row": 3, "col": 1, "input": "350" },
